    "name": "Duck Side of the Moon",
    "steam_appid": 2959770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/289a08fb10e3277b908dd77845d884e7.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/289a08fb10e3277b908dd77845d884e7.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/289a08fb10e3277b908dd77845d884e7.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around as Doug, an overworked duck astronaut looking for a new homeworld. Crashed on a strange planet of talking rocks, maybe this twist is exactly what he needs! Whether you\u2019re exploring or just soaking in the stars, this galaxy is here for you to enjoy at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/2b40bc1349a62905936313fa6bc2d44c.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/2b40bc1349a62905936313fa6bc2d44c.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/2b40bc1349a62905936313fa6bc2d44c.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world filled with secrets. Find rare minerals in glowing caves, win outfits at the town\u2019s funfair, and don\u2019t get your feathers burned in the volcano! There\u2019s surprises around every turn, whether it\u2019s the highest stars or the deepest mines, there\u2019s always something for you to discover!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/f0a5fbb5a842ad453ddba8d02b4e8e91.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/f0a5fbb5a842ad453ddba8d02b4e8e91.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/f0a5fbb5a842ad453ddba8d02b4e8e91.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky for you, this side of the galaxy is filled with curious creatures who welcome you. Build a party, solve a neighborhood mystery, win an ice cream and much more! Every task brings you closer to a community that runs on vibes, not urgency. In this world doing a little good goes a long way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/782c7fe69739667fab92dcb1cf965ab1.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/782c7fe69739667fab92dcb1cf965ab1.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/782c7fe69739667fab92dcb1cf965ab1.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your spaceship your home among the stars. Plop down a comfy couch, a cozy storage room or maybe even a basketball hoop. Fill your backpack with rare materials and return home to craft gadgets and stylish outfits. No rush, your ship isn\u2019t going anywhere without you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/289a08fb10e3277b908dd77845d884e7.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/289a08fb10e3277b908dd77845d884e7.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/289a08fb10e3277b908dd77845d884e7.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around as Doug, an overworked duck astronaut looking for a new homeworld. Crashed on a strange planet of talking rocks, maybe this twist is exactly what he needs! Whether you\u2019re exploring or just soaking in the stars, this galaxy is here for you to enjoy at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/2b40bc1349a62905936313fa6bc2d44c.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/2b40bc1349a62905936313fa6bc2d44c.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/2b40bc1349a62905936313fa6bc2d44c.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world filled with secrets. Find rare minerals in glowing caves, win outfits at the town\u2019s funfair, and don\u2019t get your feathers burned in the volcano! There\u2019s surprises around every turn, whether it\u2019s the highest stars or the deepest mines, there\u2019s always something for you to discover!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/f0a5fbb5a842ad453ddba8d02b4e8e91.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/f0a5fbb5a842ad453ddba8d02b4e8e91.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/f0a5fbb5a842ad453ddba8d02b4e8e91.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky for you, this side of the galaxy is filled with curious creatures who welcome you. Build a party, solve a neighborhood mystery, win an ice cream and much more! Every task brings you closer to a community that runs on vibes, not urgency. In this world doing a little good goes a long way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/782c7fe69739667fab92dcb1cf965ab1.poster.avif?t=1754587075\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/782c7fe69739667fab92dcb1cf965ab1.webm?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959770/extras/782c7fe69739667fab92dcb1cf965ab1.mp4?t=1754587075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your spaceship your home among the stars. Plop down a comfy couch, a cozy storage room or maybe even a basketball hoop. Fill your backpack with rare materials and return home to craft gadgets and stylish outfits. No rush, your ship isn\u2019t going anywhere without you!</p>",
